    <question no="18" id="PRB-0BBD1A560F71ADE9-Q18" type="부정형(옳지 않은 것 고르기)" category="수리·계산·자료해석형">
      <stem>모아원(Mohr’s circle)을 이용하여 평면응력을 구하는 방법에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은? (단, $x$축과 $y$축에서의 평면응력이며, 모아원의 반경 $R = \sqrt{{\left ( \frac{\sigma_{x} - \sigma_{y}}{2} \right )^{2} + ( \tau_{xy}} )^{2}}$이다)</stem>
      <formulas count="7">
        <formula area="질문">x</formula>
        <formula area="질문">y</formula>
        <formula area="질문">R = \sqrt{{left ( \frac{\sigma_{x} - \sigma_{y}}{2} right )^{2} + ( \tau_{xy}} )^{2}}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지①">\left( \frac{\sigma_{x} + \sigma_{y}}{2} , 0 right ) \right .</formula>
        <formula area="선택지②">\sigma_{1 , 2} = \frac{\sigma_{x} + \sigma_{y}}{2} \pm R</formula>
        <formula area="선택지③">\tau_{max} = R</formula>
        <formula area="선택지④">\theta_{p} = \frac{1}{2} \tan^{- 1} \left( \sqrt{{\frac{2 \tau_{xy}}{\sigma_{x} - \sigma_{y}}}} right )</formula>
      </formulas>
      <choices count="4">
        <choice no="1" is_answer="false">모아원의 중심은 $( \frac{\sigma_{x} + \sigma_{y}}{2} , 0 ) .$이다.</choice>
        <choice no="2" is_answer="false">주응력 $\sigma_{1 , 2} = \frac{\sigma_{x} + \sigma_{y}}{2} \pm R$이다.</choice>
        <choice no="3" is_answer="false">최대전단응력 $\tau_{max} = R$이다.</choice>
        <choice no="4" is_answer="true">주평면의 주각 $\theta_{p} = \frac{1}{2} \tan^{- 1} \left( \sqrt{{\frac{2 \tau_{xy}}{\sigma_{x} - \sigma_{y}}}} \right )$이다.</choice>
      </choices>
      <answer source="정답표" cross_check="">4</answer>
      <explanation_ref file="응용역학개론_해설.xml" question_no="18">정답 ④ · 수리·계산·자료해석형 (모아원, 이용하여, 평면응력, 구하)</explanation_ref>
    </question>
